    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to explore a lost temple? This is your chance. <br>Find the treasures and escape the Temple of Aluxes by solving various puzzles and challenges. <br><br>Navigate through the old temple and face a variety of challenges. Look everywhere and leave no stone unturned. <br>Interact with your surroundings by examining objects to find what you need to get out. <br>Use your scanner to scan the environment for clues. Can you find all the treasures and solve the puzzles to get out?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A variety of challenging puzzles with varying difficulty.<br></li><li>Test yourself in both logic puzzles and skill-based challenges.<br></li><li>Large play area with several rooms to explore.<br></li><li>Hand scanner to find clues.<br></li><li>Immersive environment.<br></li><li>Room-scale support.<br></li><li>Teleportation support.<br></li><li>Full locomotion support</li></ul><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
